cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cryoROLE, please cite the methods paper below (preferred citation)."
type: software
title: "cryoROLE: cryo-EM Relative Orientation LandscapE"
abstract: >-
  cryoROLE computes per-particle relative orientations between two separately
  refined, approximately rigid domains of a cryo-EM complex, maps them as a
  landscape with a local sampling density (SLD), and exports particle subsets
  from regions of that landscape as CryoSPARC or RELION metadata. It has a
  command-line interface, a desktop GUI and a Python API.
